## Rules Summary

1. ✅ Always use timeouts (job and command level)
2. ✅ Block on security gate (required)
3. ✅ Cache dependencies for speed
4. ✅ Use concurrency control
5. ✅ Report results clearly
6. ✅ Separate required vs optional steps
7. ✅ Cleanup processes after CI
8. ✅ Version pin critical tools
9. ❌ Never skip security checks
10. ❌ Never run CI without timeouts
